  "ruleText": "Env-A 1710.01 Form ARD-8, Information Required for Permits for Stationary Hot Mix Asphalt Plants. In addition to Form ARD-1, an applicant for a permit for a stationary hot mix asphalt plant shall complete and submit Form ARD-8, “Information Required for Permits for Stationary Hot Mix Asphalt Plants” dated September 9, 2019.\n\nSource. #8130, eff 7-28-04, EXPIRED: 7-28-12\n\nNew. #12965, eff 1-6-20\n\nAPPENDIX",
